Cell["Substituting the 2024-05-10 crossings", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"337bddc5-cfaa-4c1e-b5f4-d068208e68af"],

Cell["\<\
Positions are in Earth radii, times are seconds relative to crossing A, and \
the direction vector is dimensionless.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"93f3f7d3-170f-457c-9ca3-60ebe9d562e7"],

